12 calls; slowest single call 1.39s, sum of all calls 10.13s

  sequential              10.13s
  6 threads                2.07s   4.9x faster
  asyncio, 6 at a time       1.57s   6.4x faster

The ceiling is about 6x with 6 calls in flight. Each run makes its own calls
with their own latencies, so a measurement can land a little either side of it.
Rate limits set a lower ceiling still.
